{"3864230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sector 92", "steam_appid": 3864230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sector 92 mixes boxing matches, infiltration and investigations in a closed but fully explorable dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding the humanoid intruder among the 27 residents will depend on the player's reputation and investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against several fighters to gain reputation and money. Some fighters can give clues to the mysterious humanoid hiding among the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respect the curfew or risk having to flee from cybercops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak and infiltrate the security building to deactivate the camera system and prevent the mysterious humanoid from learning your combat combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/179e7c3b0f173dc27b0e2ba4c6b0a195.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/179e7c3b0f173dc27b0e2ba4c6b0a195.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/179e7c3b0f173dc27b0e2ba4c6b0a195.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive Sector 92 by taking care of your health and your stamina to be ready for your investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/89e671af7c9f6e9d436f6bb93804c429.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/89e671af7c9f6e9d436f6bb93804c429.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/89e671af7c9f6e9d436f6bb93804c429.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate and question the residents to obtain clues about the mysterious humanoid. Your reputation influences what residents say.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sector 92 mixes boxing matches, infiltration and investigations in a closed but fully explorable dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding the humanoid intruder among the 27 residents will depend on the player's reputation and investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/272437b2a7a5f413877bd0306ea50cf6.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against several fighters to gain reputation and money. Some fighters can give clues to the mysterious humanoid hiding among the residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/bab852bcdaee5ea30c3de2eed993e79e.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respect the curfew or risk having to flee from cybercops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/383642271715df5dfaa8fff3d988ddf8.mp4?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak and infiltrate the security building to deactivate the camera system and prevent the mysterious humanoid from learning your combat combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/179e7c3b0f173dc27b0e2ba4c6b0a195.poster.avif?t=1776091461\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864230/extras/179e7c3b0f173dc27b0e2ba4c6b0a195.webm?t=1776091461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st